      "content": "thanks. so u think it's just miscounting or rounding issues? i checked the pick logs and they seem fine. it's just weird that it's consistently a handful of units missing every single time. like nothing major, but just enough to be annoying. what else could cause a constant, tiny drain like that? maybe something with the scanner calibration or something?",
